# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide describes migration paths for the most important feature changes in Qiskit v1.0, organized by module.\n"
"Use the table of contents on the right side to navigate to the module you are interested in.\n"
msgstr ""
"Questa guida descrive i percorsi di migrazione per i cambiamenti più importanti nelle funzionalità di Qiskit 1.0, organizzati per modulo.\n"
"Usa il sommario sul lato destro per navigare al modulo che ti interessa.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit v1.0 migration tool {#qiskit-v10-migration-tool}"
msgstr "Strumento di migrazione Qiskit 1.0 {#qiskit-v10-migration-tool}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To ease the migration process, you can use the\n"
"[`flake8-qiskit-migration`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration)\n"
"tool to detect removed import paths in your code and suggest alternatives.\n"
msgstr ""
"Per semplificare il processo di migrazione, puoi usare lo strumento\n"
"[`flake8-qiskit-migration`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration)\n"
"per rilevare i percorsi di importazione rimossi nel tuo codice e suggerire alternative.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-pipx\" label=\"Run with pipx\" default>\n"
"      If you have [`pipx`](https://github.com/pypa/pipx) installed, simply run\n"
"      the following command.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-pipx\" label=\"Esegui con pipx\" default>\n"
"      Se hai [`pipx`](https://github.com/pypa/pipx) installato, esegui semplicemente\n"
"      il seguente comando.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      pipx run flake8-qiskit-migration <path-to-source-directory>\n"
"      ```\n"
"      This will install the package to a temporary virtual environment and run\n"
"      it on your code.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-venv\" label=\"Run with venv\" default>\n"
"      If you don't want to use `pipx`, you can manually create a new\n"
"      environment for the tool. This approach also lets you use\n"
"      [`nbqa`](https://github.com/nbQA-dev/nbQA) to check code examples in\n"
"      Jupyter notebooks. Delete the environment when you're finished.\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      pipx run flake8-qiskit-migration <path-to-source-directory>\n"
"      ```\n"
"      Questo installerà il pacchetto in un ambiente virtuale temporaneo ed eseguirà\n"
"      il controllo sul tuo codice.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-venv\" label=\"Esegui con venv\" default>\n"
"      Se non vuoi usare `pipx`, puoi creare manualmente un nuovo\n"
"      ambiente per lo strumento. Questo approccio ti consente anche di usare\n"
"      [`nbqa`](https://github.com/nbQA-dev/nbQA) per controllare esempi di codice nei\n"
"      Jupyter notebook. Elimina l'ambiente quando hai finito.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      # Make new environment and install\n"
"      python -m venv .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      source .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv/bin/activate\n"
"      pip install flake8-qiskit-migration\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      # Make new environment and install\n"
"      python -m venv .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      source .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv/bin/activate\n"
"      pip install flake8-qiskit-migration\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Run plugin on Python code\n"
"      flake8 --select QKT100 <path-to-source-directory>  # e.g. `src/`\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Run plugin on Python code\n"
"      flake8 --select QKT100 <path-to-source-directory>  # e.g. `src/`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # (Optional) run plugin on notebooks\n"
"      pip install nbqa\n"
"      nbqa flake8 ./**/*.ipynb --select QKT100\n"
msgstr ""
"      # (Optional) run plugin on notebooks\n"
"      pip install nbqa\n"
"      nbqa flake8 ./**/*.ipynb --select QKT100\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Deactivate and delete environment\n"
"      deactivate\n"
"      rm -r .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Deactivate and delete environment\n"
"      deactivate\n"
"      rm -r .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limitations\">\n"
"This tool only detects removed import paths. It does not detect the use of removed\n"
"methods (such as `QuantumCircuit.qasm`) or arguments. It also can't keep track\n"
"of assignments such as `qk = qiskit`, although it can handle aliases such as\n"
"`import qiskit as qk`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limitazioni\">\n"
"Questo strumento rileva solo i percorsi di importazione rimossi. Non rileva l'uso di\n"
"metodi rimossi (come `QuantumCircuit.qasm`) né di argomenti. Non è in grado di tenere traccia\n"
"di assegnazioni come `qk = qiskit`, anche se gestisce alias come\n"
"`import qiskit as qk`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more information, see the [project's\n"
"repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration).\n"
msgstr ""
"Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta il [repository del\n"
"progetto](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration).\n"

